#, no-wrap
msgid "Naming"
msgstr "命名"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/temporal-summary.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "**时间摘要** (`temporal_summary`) — digests **of conversation content**, bucketed by **day / month / year**. Not a memory taxonomy entry (semantic / limbic / narrative), not diary prose, not the runtime compression `summary` segment.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/concepts/temporal-summary.md:14
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Diary"
msgid "vs Diary"
msgstr "日记"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/temporal-summary.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Cognitive type   | Description                                                                                 |\n"
#| "| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
#| "| Episodic         | Conversation archive; full history retained                                                 |\n"
#| "| Semantic         | Cross-session facts, preferences, experiences; **`procedural` type** for \"how-to\" knowledge |\n"
#| "| Limbic           | Emotional anchors and imprints — \"what was felt\"                                            |\n"
#| "| Autobiographical | Meaning of important experiences; recalled on demand                                        |\n"
msgid ""
"| Axis           | Diary                  | Temporal summary                                                       |\n"
"| -------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Stance         | Subjective             | Objective                                                              |\n"
"| Selection      | Editorial              | Indiscriminate coverage of active sessions                             |\n"
"| Storage        | `diary_entry` + blocks | Global → entity; today per-conversation → `conversations.temporal_day` |\n"
"| Primary reader | `/diary` UI            | System prompt (yesterday+) / timeline inject (today peers)             |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 认知类型                  | 说明                                                                 |\n"
"| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Episodic（情景）          | 对话归档；保留完整历史                                               |\n"
"| Semantic（语义）          | 跨 sessions 的事实、偏好、经历；“how-to” 知识用 **`procedural` 类型** |\n"
"| Limbic（感性）            | 情绪锚点与印记——“感受到什么”                                         |\n"
"| Autobiographical（自传） | 重要经历的意义；按需召回                                             |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/temporal-summary.md:24
msgid ""
"LLM compression still applies (char caps). **Objective ≠ exhaustive log "
"replay**: cover events without an editorial “worth remembering” filter, but "
"write **event-level** digests (themes + outcomes). Omit internal IDs, step-"
"by-step tool/config actions, and per-notification timestamps unless "
"essential to understand what happened."
msgstr ""

